":"","content":"They honestly don't feel any different from the Solar versions of those charms. They're so similar that rather than call attention to the differences between Solars and Lunars, it makes Lunars look like Silver Solars - which can only harm both splats.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11652-putty","name":"putty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}